{
  "name": "KeyIsTheFirstKey",
  "comment": "item-doors 39: a plural plang reaches is a singular node. A dict's key, read alone, is its first key; `.list` is\nevery key, in the order they were set. Red before: a dict had no `!key` fact (only `!keys`, a list), so `%person!key%` was not set.",
